# Public metadata. Private images.

Release Mirror gives dependency tools a public catalogue of container tags,
digests and platforms. Your container images, registry credentials and source
stay in your existing systems.

A producer builds and pushes an image, then publishes its actual tags and image
digest to Release Mirror. Readers and Renovate can discover that metadata
without signing in or accessing the private registry.

